  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administration costs, this acitivity covers the costs of project management at MSB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rvaltningskostnader f&#xf6;r beredskap</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rvaltningskostnader f&#xf6;r beredskap, denna post t&#xe4;cker de kostnader som myndigheten har f&#xf6;r projektledning, rekrytering mm.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support cost (MSB-HQ), costs for project management of MSB staff to manage int.operations</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultatet &#xe4;r att MSB ska ha kapacitet att initiera, leda och hantera insatser till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r EU, FN och OSCE (tidigare ocks&#xe5; TIPH) fredsfr&#xe4;mjande verksamhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results is to ensure capacity at HQ level at MSB to administer and manage peace support to UN, OSCE, (TIPH) and EU.</narrative>
  </description>
